# bof

Nana told me that buffer overflow is one of the most common software vulnerability. Is that true?

## Remote

Direct connection: `nc pwnable.kr 10003`

bof binary is running at "nc pwnable.kr 10003" under bof_pwn privilege.
get shell and read flag

## Local run

Run `./run.sh`, then connect with `nc 127.0.0.1 10003`.
